{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Ella Stars \u2013 Action, Rhythm, and Style\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfb8 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-rhythm gameplay meets original soundtracks, hand-drawn art, lovable characters, and epic boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" aria-label=\"See Ella battling a boss that looks like a DJ behind a giant speaker.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Original Songs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ella and Bird have an origin story with 50+ million views on YouTube across 49 hilarious music-based animated episodes. <strong><i>Ella Stars</i></strong>\u00a0is basically a playable greatest hits album with hand-drawn art and tight gameplay as grace notes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" aria-label=\"A record player showing the game&#039;s song selection UI.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fourth-Wall-Breaking Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well not narratively, but you can crush each unique boss with a perfect combo at the end for a satisfying crescendo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" aria-label=\"Ella crushes a guitar-wielding boss against the screen, shattering it.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Crazy Hard to Kick Back &amp; Chill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either keep it on easy with Ella to enjoy the great OST, or move through difficulty modes until the bosses break you (or you break the game, then we humbly concede to your mastery).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" aria-label=\"Shows Ella in Fever mode, packed with color, speed, and gameplay enhancement.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Close This in Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no journey of self-discovery and musical mayhem is complete without costumes to match your style. 7 unique skins to unlock (and email us to ask for more anytime).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401870?t=1768633228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/53093c9a1ad003d3e1b82bdc073c0c446a9da0d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768633228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/96b6a879b42a2930447ff457ba164a5a0de47093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768633228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/96b6a879b42a2930447ff457ba164a5a0de47093/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768633228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3418980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\u