type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Close This in Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no journey of self-discovery and musical mayhem is complete without costumes to match your style. 7 unique skins to unlock (and email us to ask for more anytime).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.poster.avif?t=1768633228\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.webm?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.mp4?t=1768633228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SUSUSOFT"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/c3d6ec6bf4ef91f2a726a44c1366c128f116cfec/header.jpg?t=1768633228","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3401870/356852249/87da4c6e98709b86709c0bcd9dc87dab1cb023dd/1750847606/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750136279","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3401870/356852249/87da4c6e98709b86709c0bcd9dc87dab1cb023dd/1750847606/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750136279","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3401870/356852249/87da4c6e98709b86709c0bcd9dc87dab1cb023dd/1750847606/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750136279","id":257119411,"name":"Play Movie Footage","thumbnail